Hello team,

Following the new weighbridges at our two largest sites, we are widening the tolerance in
client memo CM-INF-02 for Arvana Infra Projects.

With effect from 16 November 2026, for cement, reinforcement steel, sand and aggregates only,
an invoice quantity up to 7% above the GRN quantity is accepted. The value cap per line in
CM-INF-02 is unchanged. Until 15 November 2026 the current 5% continues to apply.

All other terms of CM-INF-02 stay as they are, including its expiry on 31 March 2027.

